      "content": "Your symptoms are a classic sign of a severe allergic reaction, not just anxiety, and you need to take Benadryl immediately to stop the swelling.\nSince your throat feels tight, you should also take an antihistamine like Claritin right away to block the histamine response.\nIf you feel dizzy or can't breathe after taking the pills, call 911 right now because this could be anaphylaxis.\nDo not wait to see if it gets better on its own, as the swelling can progress quickly and become life-threatening.",
